      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Original graph for this repo. It uses core ComfyUI nodes: Load Video, Get Video Components, Load Upscale Model, Upscale Image (using Model), Create Video, Save Video. The core upscaler tiles frames (512px, overlap 32).\n\nWeights, from the Real-ESRGAN releases (xinntao/Real-ESRGAN):\n- RealESRGAN_x4plus.pth \u2014 https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN/releases/download/v0.1.0/RealESRGAN_x4plus.pth\n- RealESRGAN_x2plus.pth \u2014 https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN/releases/download/v0.2.1/RealESRGAN_x2plus.pth\n\nThe loader is set to RealESRGAN_x4plus.pth. Switch model_name to RealESRGAN_x2plus.pth for a 2x pass.\n\nPut the source clip in ComfyUI/input and pick it on Load Video. x4 on a long 720p clip uses a lot of RAM; trim the clip first. Video Helper Suite is installed if you want its loader instead, but this graph does not require it.\n\nSeedVR2 is a separate opt-in graph: wan22_upscale_seedvr2.json."
      ]
    }
